      "reason": "equivalent, unreachable: the only caller, amendment_lineage_while_admitted, passes as builds what ledger::read_lineage returns for the named batch's identity, and read_lineage keeps only batch records whose identity_batch_id equals it, so every build shares the identity and this check never refuses. A caller that takes its builds from anywhere else reopens it"
    },
